# Glue for dublin_core_terms.ttl: the DCMI file describes the namespace
# document but never types it, so Visoto's owl:Ontology template cannot find
# it. Every term already carries rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://purl.org/dc/terms/> a owl:Ontology .
